<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Adaptive-icon foreground for the Exhale brand mark.

    WHY THE INSET: an adaptive icon's foreground layer is 108x108dp but the launcher only
    guarantees the centre 72x72dp "safe zone" survives masking — the outer 18dp on every
    edge is reserved for parallax/mask bleed. @drawable/ic_launcher_img is a full-bleed
    artwork (the neon "E))" over its own dark radial backdrop), so handing it to the
    foreground raw made the mark render at 108/72 = 1.5x — visibly zoomed, with the glyph's
    outer strokes clipped by the launcher's circle/squircle mask.

    Insetting 16% on each edge maps the artwork onto ~76x76dp of the 108dp canvas, which sits
    just inside the safe zone with a hair of breathing room, and keeps it perfectly centred
    for every mask shape (circle, squircle, rounded square, teardrop). The 108dp layer itself
    is unchanged, so the launcher's parallax still has room to travel.

    Edit the four inset values together — asymmetric insets break the centring.
-->
<inset xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:drawable="@drawable/ic_launcher_img"
    android:insetLeft="16%"
    android:insetTop="16%"
    android:insetRight="16%"
    android:insetBottom="16%" />
